WEBVTT

NOTE Transcribed and translated in Translator (first 30s). Not YouTube automatic captions.

00:00:00.079 --> 00:00:04.219
I think this is probably the person the viewers of "Hi-Story" want to see the most.

00:00:04.219 --> 00:00:05.618
We have director Park Chan-wook with us.

00:00:05.618 --> 00:00:06.219
Welcome.

00:00:06.219 --> 00:00:08.460
Hello.

00:00:08.460 --> 00:00:12.659
It feels like we're starting today as if this were a fan meeting.

00:00:12.659 --> 00:00:20.100
Director, in fact, you just finished handling such a very complicated and packed schedule at the Cannes Film Festival, and it's only been about two or three days since you came back, so now we're recording…

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:22.579
At this point in time, I imagine you still haven't really adjusted to the time difference.

00:00:22.579 --> 00:00:24.178
Yes, I only slept three hours.

00:00:24.178 --> 00:00:24.939
Oh dear.

00:00:24.939 --> 00:00:27.599
Yes, I'm holding on with sheer willpower.

00:00:27.599 --> 00:00:30.000
Audiences are really eager to see Decision to Leave now.
